WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.660 line:90%
Mr President majority leader

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:04.140 line:90%
our bipartisan,

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:06.950 line:90%
bicameral discussions on another

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.600 line:90%
major pandemic rescue package

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.570 line:90%
continued all night and this

00:00:11.570 --> 00:00:13.790 line:90%
morning we're winnowing down

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.800 line:90%
the remaining differences I

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.060 line:90%
believe I can speak for all

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:18.620 line:90%
sides when I say I hope

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.910 line:90%
and expect to have a final

00:00:19.910 --> 00:00:21.380 line:90%
agreement nailed down

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.930 line:90%
in a matter of hours yesterday

00:00:23.930 --> 00:00:24.980 line:90%
evening our Democratic

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:26.340 line:90%
colleagues agreed to important

00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:28.610 line:90%
language authored by Senator

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:31.070 line:90%
Toomey back in March

00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:33.350 line:90%
and the kahrizak Congress funded

00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:35.000 line:90%
several new emergency lending

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.950 line:90%
facilities to be operated

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:39.140 line:90%
by the Federal Reserve

00:00:39.140 --> 00:00:41.510 line:90%
their purpose was simple

00:00:41.510 --> 00:00:42.830 line:90%
to backstop the basic

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.330 line:90%
foundations of our economy

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:46.580 line:90%
and prevent any kind of sweeping

00:00:46.580 --> 00:00:50.210 line:90%
financial paralysis our actions

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.490 line:90%
worked the other historic relief

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.080 line:90%
that Congress passed combined

00:00:54.080 --> 00:00:55.280 line:90%
with the existence of these

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:57.380 line:90%
lending facilities staved off

00:00:57.380 --> 00:01:00.170 line:90%
systemic collapse American

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.670 line:90%
workers and families still need

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.410 line:90%
much more help but a total

00:01:03.410 --> 00:01:05.360 line:90%
financial meltdown never

00:01:05.360 --> 00:01:08.730 line:90%
materialized these new emergency

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.200 line:90%
lending facilities were always

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.810 line:90%
intended to sunset at the end

00:01:12.810 --> 00:01:15.060 line:90%
of this year Senator Toomey

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:16.260 line:90%
and our Democratic colleagues

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:17.520 line:90%
have landed on compromise

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:20.250 line:90%
language that ensures this will

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:23.330 line:90%
in fact happen.

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:24.910 line:90%
It also redirects the dormant

00:01:24.910 --> 00:01:26.140 line:90%
money in these accounts toward

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:27.700 line:90%
the urgent needs of working

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:29.680 line:90%
Americans and ensures that these

00:01:29.680 --> 00:01:31.210 line:90%
expiring programs cannot be

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.790 line:90%
simply restarted or closed

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:35.890 line:90%
without another authorization

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.210 line:90%
from Congress all while

00:01:38.210 --> 00:01:39.710 line:90%
preserving both the independence

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:40.670 line:90%
of the Federal Reserve

00:01:40.670 --> 00:01:42.830 line:90%
and a property proper authority

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:46.340 line:90%
of Congress yet another example

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.630 line:90%
of good faith bipartisan

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:49.370 line:90%
collaboration that has defined

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:53.030 line:90%
our discussions all week at this

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:54.560 line:90%
point we're down to the last few

00:01:54.560 --> 00:01:55.910 line:90%
differences this time between

00:01:55.910 --> 00:01:56.930 line:90%
struggling Americans

00:01:56.930 --> 00:01:59.310 line:90%
and their major rescue package,

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:02.720 line:90%
they need and deserve these days

00:02:02.720 --> 00:02:03.960 line:90%
and nights of negotiations have

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:04.760 line:90%
been encouraging

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:05.990 line:90%
but our citizens need this

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:08.960 line:90%
waiting game to be over

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:12.260 line:90%
yesterday alone another 3,388

00:02:12.260 --> 00:02:14.540 line:90%
of my fellow Kentuckians tested

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:17.130 line:90%
positive for the coronavirus

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:18.570 line:90%
the continues to spread

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:19.920 line:90%
throughout our country thousands

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.180 line:90%
of Americans are being robbed

00:02:21.180 --> 00:02:24.150 line:90%
of their lives on a daily basis

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:25.260 line:90%
and while the resilience

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.310 line:90%
of the American people have

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.780 line:90%
brought along our economic

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:29.790 line:90%
recovery recovery faster than

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:32.430 line:90%
expected it will remain both

00:02:32.430 --> 00:02:34.680 line:90%
insufficient and tenuous until

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.240 line:90%
the vaccines that will end this

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:38.730 line:90%
fight have been distributed all

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:42.430 line:90%
across the nation for months,

00:02:42.430 --> 00:02:43.980 line:90%
literally months Senate

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.240 line:90%
Republicans have been calling

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:47.700 line:90%
for another targeted package

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:49.290 line:90%
to reopen the job saving

00:02:49.290 --> 00:02:51.750 line:90%
Paycheck Protection Program

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:53.310 line:90%
extend federal unemployment

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.270 line:90%
benefits fund K through 12

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:59.840 line:90%
school fund vaccine distribution

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:01.550 line:90%
and get a lot more help onto

00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:03.530 line:90%
the front lines as fast

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:06.200 line:90%
as possible I'm relieved that we

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.700 line:90%
appear to be just hours away

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.290 line:90%
from legislation that will

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.230 line:90%
finally do that when we get this

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:13.820 line:90%
done Congress will not deserve

00:03:13.820 --> 00:03:16.010 line:90%
any special praise not with this

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.660 line:90%
relief having waited until late

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:19.790 line:90%
December and not with some

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:20.960 line:90%
of our Democratic colleagues

00:03:20.960 --> 00:03:22.310 line:90%
openly saying the reason they

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.610 line:90%
finally changed their tune was

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:24.410 line:90%
they finally got

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:25.700 line:90%
a President-elect of their own

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.000 line:90%
party when we finalize this

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:31.870 line:90%
measure and pass it Congress

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:32.670 line:90%
will

00:03:32.670 --> 00:03:35.190 line:90%
all have done our job we will

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.420 line:90%
have finally done our duty

00:03:36.420 --> 00:03:38.940 line:90%
and getting more relief to those

00:03:38.940 --> 00:03:41.810 line:90%
who need it most let's make

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:44.030 line:90%
today the day we join together

00:03:44.030 --> 00:03:46.070 line:90%
put differences aside

00:03:46.070 --> 00:03:49.090 line:90%
and finally get it done.

